older Katie.

131
00:05:09.935 --> 00:05:11.686
the Katie you don't want
to be around.

132
00:05:11.686 --> 00:05:15.398
And I'm always going to be
protective with Stassi.

133
00:05:15.398 --> 00:05:19.277
So if this is how you feel
about Stassi's friends.

134
00:05:19.277 --> 00:05:21.279
