151
00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:05.323
- Oh.

152
00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:07.325
Hey.
- Hi.

153
00:06:07.325 --> 00:06:09.244
- The hair's--I'm obsessed.

154
00:06:09.244 --> 00:06:11.871
It looks so good.
- Thank you.

155
00:06:11.871 --> 00:06:15.125
- I've known Ariana
for 14 years.

156
00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:18.420
We were on reality TV
for over a decade together.

157
00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:23.508
And about five years ago.
we started a business.

158
00:06:23.508 --> 00:06:24.634
