159
00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:26.636
- My fiancé.
- Do you love saying it?

160
00:06:26.636 --> 00:06:30.473
- Yeah. it is really fun
to say "my fiancé."

161
00:06:30.473 --> 00:06:33.393
- I think a major catalyst
for Ariana and Stassi

162
00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:36.021
