Ariana was with Tom Sandoval.

163
00:06:36.021 --> 00:06:37.856
And he really
didn't like Stassi.

164
00:06:37.856 --> 00:06:40.525
So it kind of kept Ariana
from really getting to know

165
00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:42.485
Stassi in a meaningful way.

166
00:06:42.485 --> 00:06:44.154
ARIANA: How's filming been?

167
00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:47.907
- I met up with Stassi
the other day.

168
00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:52.120
Which I haven't done in years.

169
00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:54.664
So when I decided
that I was gonna

170
00:06:54.664 --> 00:06:56.583
come be a part of the show.
I told her about it.

171
00:06:56.583 --> 00:06:58.793
And she was actually
very happy for me.

172
00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:00.587
