for a long time.

176
00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.762
And. you know. she's like.
you were being. like. selfish

177
00:07:08.762 --> 00:07:10.013
and talking about this.

178
00:07:10.013 --> 00:07:12.307
And I think.
where was the understanding

179
00:07:12.307 --> 00:07:14.768
that my whole life was
just turned upside down?

180
00:07:14.768 --> 00:07:16.019
I was going through divorce.

181
00:07:16.019 --> 00:07:17.187
Yeah. I was being selfish.

182
00:07:17.187 --> 00:07:18.313
And I think I deserved
to be selfish.

183
00:07:18.313 --> 00:07:19.773
- Yeah. that's OK
to be selfish.

184
00:07:19.773 --> 00:07:21.191
especially during that time.

185
00:07:21.191 --> 00:07:23.360
- Stassi was queen of being
selfish for a long time.

186
00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:28.615
I get not wanting to [bleep]
with people who just drain you.

187
00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:31.201
but. like. also.
do you have any friends?

188
00:07:31.201 --> 00:07:32.494
- [laughs]

189
00:07:32.494 --> 00:07:33.703
- Besides. you know.
your husband.

190
00:07:33.703 --> 00:07:35.205
