and your assistant. like--

191
00:07:35.205 --> 00:07:36.706
- I mean.
you guys are best friends.

192
00:07:36.706 --> 00:07:39.751
I feel like we've all grown.

193
00:07:39.751 --> 00:07:42.754
Like. I would like to think
that she has as well.

194
00:07:42.754 --> 00:07:44.631
- I think she definitely--
I mean. I know it's easy

195
00:07:44.631 --> 00:07:47.050
to say. like. OK. well.
she had done this in the past

196
00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.593
and didn't grow from it
and did this in the past.

197
00:07:48.593 --> 00:07:52.764
But I think the level
of this accountability

198
00:07:52.764 --> 00:07:55.684
that she had to face
is unparalleled.

199
00:08:00.355 --> 00:08:02.232
- I definitely had
people questioning

200
00:08:02.232 --> 00:08:04.025
my friendship with her
and why I was

201
00:08:04.025 --> 00:08:05.735
not speaking out against her.

202
00:08:05.735 --> 00:08:08.196
But I've known Stassi
for so many years.

203
00:08:08.196 --> 00:08:10.281
You know. she was
a bit ignorant at times

204
00:08:10.281 --> 00:08:11.950
and wouldn't think
before she spoke.

205
00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.536
so I think that was a real.
like. reckoning with her.

206
00:08:14.536 --> 00:08:18.248
And I think she took it
very seriously.

207
00:08:18.248 --> 00:08:20.417
Stassi started
listening to people.

208
00:08:20.417 --> 00:08:22.836
Rather than becoming defensive.
you listen.

209
00:08:22.836 --> 00:08:25.588
And you learn
where your blind spots are.

210
00:08:25.588 --> 00:08:27.507
what. you know.
certain microaggressions

211
00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:28.925
you've had in the past.

212
00:08:28.925 --> 00:08:32.595
And you kind of sit with that
and learn from it.

213
00:08:32.595 --> 00:08:34.931
It's a tender topic.
But. like. it is what it is.

214
00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:36.725
- Yeah.
Well. I'm glad you guys talked.

215
00:08:36.725 --> 00:08:38.893
I mean. I think
there's probably a way

216
00:08:38.893 --> 00:08:41.395
to just figure out. like.
what works for you guys now.

217
00:08:41.395 --> 00:08:44.274
- But it can't just be on me.

218
00:08:44.274 --> 00:08:46.651
I've always kept it real
with Stassi.

219
00:08:46.651 --> 00:08:50.071
And in this new chapter
of Stassi/Katie 2.0.

220
00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:51.948
I'm gonna continue
to keep it real.

221
00:08:51.948 --> 00:08:55.118
If I'm gonna make that effort
to be a part of your life.

222
00:08:55.118 --> 00:08:56.995
you need to make that
to be part of mine too.

223
00:08:56.995 --> 00:08:58.329
It's a two-way street.

224
00:08:58.329 --> 00:09:00.123
I really don't want
to repeat history

225
00:09:00.123 --> 00:09:02.792
and go through another
toxic friendship cycle

226
00:09:02.792 --> 00:09:04.169
all on TV again.

227
00:09:04.169 --> 00:09:05.962
So if it ends up
going down that path.

228
00:09:05.962 --> 00:09:07.964
I have no problem walking away.

229
00:09:10.341 --> 00:09:13.428
[light music]

230
00:09:13.428 --> 00:09:16.890
- I wish I was going
to speak at some--

231
00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.017
I don't know.
what do people speak at?

232
00:09:19.017 --> 00:09:21.227
Styling days are
my favorite days

233
00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:23.188
because I get to do these
from home.

234
00:09:23.188 --> 00:09:24.355
And I get to look
through clothes.

235
00:09:24.355 --> 00:09:26.941
And I get to like.

236
00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:28.818
I don't know.
help Beau with the kids

237
00:09:28.818 --> 00:09:30.612
while I'm trying on
cute outfits.

238
00:09:30.612 --> 00:09:32.155
It's like. win-win.

239
00:09:32.155 --> 00:09:34.240
- You just look so good
in. like. a peplum.

240
00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.242
- Oh. I love a peplum.
And I'm so glad they're back.

241
00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:37.827
This is so Cynthia Erivo

242
00:09:37.827 --> 00:09:39.245
if I was going
to the Wicked premiere.

243
00:09:39.245 --> 00:09:40.663
MAREN: This is so you.
So I'm glad you tried it.

244
00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:42.165
- Gorge. Gorge.

245
00:09:45.126 --> 00:09:48.213
- Tonight. so Sonia is
gonna stay until 7:00.

246
00:09:48.213 --> 00:09:49.464
